            "review_title": "Review at Phở Trang Võ Văn Tần",
            "review_text": "Victoria M.Sinclair\nVietnam2 contributions\n0\nMore Than Pho: A True Taste of Saigon at Phở Trang\nSep 2025 • Family\nPhở Trang on Võ Văn Tần is a timeless local favorite, serving rich, aromatic pho that captures the essence of Saigon. The clear yet flavorful broth is slow-simmered with beef bones and spices, paired with silky noodles and toppings from rare beef to brisket, tendon, or meatballs. What sets it apart are the house-made chili sauce, fermented soybean paste, and fresh organic herbs that brighten every bowl. A must-visit stop for travelers seeking true Vietnamese flavor\nRead more\nWritten September 28, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
